WEBVTT

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:02.980
<b>A demon god</b>

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.850
N-No...

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:06.360
<b>Heavenly clouds</b>

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.360
<b>Hell</b>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.400
Turn this place into Hell!

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:12.920
As you wish!

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.670
That can't be... Kan'u!

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.500
I won't let you escape, Shuuyu!

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.240
Are you okay, Sonshin?

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.000
Yeah, but Ryou'un...

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.240
Hakuanshi-sama, are you hurt?

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.440
I'm fine.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:35.010
This wasn't quite the original plan,
but it's perfect.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:39.510
Kan'u, show me your power

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:41.880
as the god of war!

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:46.020
Attack, spirits of the dead!

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:22.490
Ryou'un!

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:31.880
Seriously?

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:34.500
He knocked away the spirits of 
the dead without moving a foot?

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.060
There's no doubt about it.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.760
He's every bit the monster the rumors say!

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:39.880
Sousei!

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:41.150
That fool...

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:42.630
Ryou'un, that's enough!

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.080
Return Kan'u to his card!

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:45.990
Cease!

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.570
She's lost her sanity!

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:49.200
But...

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.520
Do it, Kan'u!

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:51.810
Get back, Sonshin!

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:59.120
This is a bit difficult.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:03.790
Kan'u's raging power has 
amplified the girl's rage.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:08.440
There's no way to stop him until 
his lord is drained of power and dies.

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:12.170
Then I'll make her use 
all her spiritual energy.

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:14.140
Yes, thank you.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.800
They're going crazy.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:25.900
This Hakuanshi's a dangerous guy.

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:29.290
I pray I don't have to use this.

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:33.740
General Kan'u, prepare to die!

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:37.260
Are you okay?

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:38.470
Yeah.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.410
We need to hurry and stop Ryou'un.

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:41.450
What are you talking about?

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:44.370
She doesn't even know who's an 
enemy and who isn't right now!

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.490
That doesn't mean we can let her die!

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.540
I promised her grandfather

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:53.110
that I would be her sheath 
if something happens.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:54.880
Ryou'un,

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.380
don't let your rage overwhelm you.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.400
My desire is for...

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.600
destruction!

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.260
Stop it, Ryou'un!

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.760
If you use all your
spiritual energy, you'll die!

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.760
Damn, it's not working!

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:12.680
Shuuyu!

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:14.480
Don't try to show off, you good-for-nothing!

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.410
We'll work together and get close!

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:16.980
Yeah!

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:27.120
He's as much a demon god as the rumors say.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:30.550
He's treating Teifu like a child, 
without even using a weapon.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:36.380
I want you even more now, Kan'u.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:37.750
Stay away!

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:41.760
Sonshin, stay calm!

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:45.630
If we don't hurry, Ryou'un will 
use all her spiritual energy!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:50.940
It's true that she's putting out 
more spiritual energy than before.

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:55.230
She's using a lot to 
power Kan'u to begin with.

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:58.760
If she uses this much on her own,

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.510
a certain death awaits her!

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:07.800
It's as if you're treating me like a child.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:08.490
But...

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:14.390
Your weapon won't let you 
get close easily, Kan'u!

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:15.540
Take this!

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:17.670
Hyappo Zenbai!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.040
<b>Hyappo Zenbai</b>

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:27.670
You blocked my Hyappo Zenbai?

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:30.150
Splendid!

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.600
Teifu went down so easily.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:37.900
I thought he'd last longer.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:41.300
I guess I was wrong, Teifu.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:44.380
Bad news!

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:45.360
Kan'u saw us!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.050
I'll draw him away!

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.350
You help Ryou'un while I do!

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:49.700
Yeah, right!

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:52.410
Ryou'un, come to your senses!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:55.080
Now come! I'll fight you!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.640
This is perfect.

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:05.760
Excellent, Kan'u.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:08.010
Devour your lord's spiritual energy!

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.690
Ryou'un, please!

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:11.010
Listen to me!

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:13.010
Don't let the rage swallow you!

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.640
Are you an enemy, too?

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:18.390
Of course... not!

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.560
Retsuouken!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.560
<b>Retsuouken</b>

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:25.760
Rairyuu Engetsu!

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.240
<b>Rairyuu Engetsu</b>

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:37.200
<i>This is bad, Sonshin!</i>

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.800
<i>His spiritual energy is dropping!</i>

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.080
<i>Save Ryou'un, quickly!</i>

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.710
Ryou'un, this is where you grew up, right?

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:47.660
Don't you feel anything?

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.720
Don't touch me!

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:55.600
That wound is from when 
you protected Shuusou, right?

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.350
<i>Wound...</i>

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:58.620
Even if your memories are gone,

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:00.600
your bond isn't!

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:03.830
My bond isn't gone?

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.260
What is Hakuanshi-sama doing?

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:14.430
We need to run.

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:15.600
Run?

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:16.660
Of course not.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:20.410
Sousei, I'll give you another chance.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:24.170
Even you can shoot a single girl, right?

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.870
A girl?

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:27.670
You mean that girl, Ryou'un?

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:28.460
Yes.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:32.300
Strike her while her 
spiritual power is quelled,

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.560
and become a hero.

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:37.010
The hero who slew Kan'u!

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:39.110
I'll become a hero?

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:41.050
Yes.

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:44.650
I'll make you strong with this card.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.900
Ryou'un, you remember, right?

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:53.910
I'll kill you in one strike.

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:56.430
My general...

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:57.410
That's right!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.160
Sonshin, he's aiming at you!

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:09.850
I'm fine!

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:13.010
No need to worry!

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.150
Shuusou...

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:21.500
Kan'u!

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:23.020
Stop it!

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:27.900
I'm sorry, Kan'u.

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:32.310
I almost caused him to make a mistake.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.160
Put your weapon away.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:44.490
I seem to have finally met 
a lord worthy of my service!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:51.800
How long must you interfere with my plans?

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:57.420
Show yourself, coward!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.820
I was just ordered to do it!

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:07.630
I didn't have a choice when 
I killed your general!

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:09.530
You killed Shuusou?

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:10.770
No, I...

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:11.870
I know!

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:13.400
I'll join you!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.690
Let's all defeat Hakuanshi!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:18.500
Please!

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:20.280
Any closer and I'll kill you!

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:22.540
Let me join you!

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:24.440
What is that spiritual aura?

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:26.160
No! It's a trap?

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.340
It doesn't hurt.

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:35.130
What's going on with my body?

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.140
He's being controlled with evil magic!

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.990
Hakuanshi,

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:43.680
what did you do to my body?

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:47.440
Is that not a noble way to die?

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:52.740
I wish I could've met a good lord, too.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.090
What?

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:59.220
Is he a lord?

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:02.450
Take this!

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:06.500
No! This technique is...

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.080
What is it?

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:08.880
Oh, no!

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.500
Is it Happobaku?

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.250
That's right.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.800
But the fun's just beginning!

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:20.890
Excellent, Ukitsu.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:23.720
Your spell allows you to steal a general.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.210
Show it to them.

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:26.120
Take that.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:33.230
That's right.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:36.820
Ryou'un, turn Kan'u into a card!

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.740
But I can't move!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.120
Struggling is useless.

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:46.870
Now Kan'u is mine!

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.250
Take this!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:56.510
You're...

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:58.510
Sheesh...

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:02.540
You're making me look like a hero!

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:03.760
That's so lame.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.260
Who is he?

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:08.980
Are you Hakuanshi?

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:11.140
How dare you interrupt my spell...

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:13.290
What is this?

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.150
Hey... You can't be...

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:18.650
I-I...

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:19.870
You...

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:20.650
You can't be...

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:22.660
What happened to me?

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:24.980
To my body?

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.910
<b>Demon</b>

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.150
A raging god shrinks.

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:04.570
His power drains.

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:06.500
The clouds murmur,

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:09.190
calling a powerful warrior.

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:11.000
The rain stops,

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.080
the sky quickens,

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.020
and none shall escape.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:17.460
Next time: "Collapse."
